Nickel third-party license notices
==================================

This file is generated from the exact Cargo.lock dependency graph. Each license text is followed by
the resolved crates that use it. Regenerate with:

    cargo about generate --locked --workspace --all-features \
      --target x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu --target x86_64-pc-windows-gnu --fail \
      --config packaging/about.toml packaging/third-party-licenses.hbs \
      --output-file packaging/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt

